#: Youtube_settings.py:458
msgid ""
"How to get YouTube cookies:\n"
"\n"
"Option 1 (automatic): Use the 'Export YouTube Cookies (Anti-Block)' button below. Close your browser first, then press it and pick your browser from the list.\n"
"\n"
"Option 2 (manual):\n"
"1. Install 'Get cookies.txt' extension in Chrome or Firefox\n"
"2. Login to YouTube in your browser\n"
"3. Click the extension icon and export cookies\n"
"4. Save as cookies.txt and select it here\n"
"\n"
"Using cookies helps avoid blocks because YouTube sees you as a logged-in user."
msgstr ""
"Cara mendapatkan koin YouTube:\n"
"\n"
"Opsi 1 (otomatis): Gunakan tombol 'Ekspor Koin YouTube (Anti-Blokir)' di bawah ini. Tutup peramban Anda terlebih dahulu, lalu tekan dan pilih peramban Anda dari daftar.\n"
"\n"
"Opsi 2 (manual):\n"
"1. Pasang ekstensi 'Get cookies.txt' di Chrome atau Firefox\n"
"2. Masuk ke YouTube di peramban Anda\n"
"3. Klik ikon ekstensi dan ekspor koin\n"
"4. Simpan sebagai cookies.txt dan pilih di sini\n"
"\n"
"Menggunakan koin membantu menghindari pemblokiran karena YouTube melihat Anda sebagai pengguna yang masuk."

